{
  "meta": {
    "document": "Hot Spring County FY2025 Appropriation",
    "title": "Hot Spring County — the money trail",
    "grand_total": 17543508.72,
    "year": 2025,
    "note": "Arkansas counties appropriate fund by fund, and the ordinance prints no single all-funds total (the General Fund total also includes transfers that fund other listed funds, so a naive sum would double-count). This tree avoids that: the General Fund is shown at its department subtotal, and each dedicated fund — Road, the Hospital Sales Tax, Solid Waste, 9-1-1, the Library and the rest — stands beside it, so every dollar is counted once. The total shown is the honest sum of the appropriations, from the county’s FY2025 appropriation on the Arkansas transparency portal. The adopted FY2026 ordinance (a 4% raise, sheriff vehicles) is not yet posted — it is docket item #1."
  },
